//  PETPORTS -- LAMP MODULE LIGHT
//
//  THE WHOLE EFFECT IS THIS FILE. A status effect's animationConfig gets its
//  own animator on the wearer, and a `lights` block in one is a real world
//  light -- no script, no part, no drawable.
//
//  POSITION IS [0, 0] BECAUSE THAT IS THE BODY CENTRE, and that is what lets
//  the flip script go. See the .statuseffect for the reasoning; the short
//  version is that a centred light looks identical mirrored, and every unit
//  chassis in this mod has its collisionPoly centred on the origin.
//
//  pointLight -- a plain radial source rather than a directional beam. A beam
//  would need a facing, which is the thing we just removed.

{
	"lights" : {
		"petports_module_lamp" : {
			"active" : true,
			"position" : [ 0.0, 0.0 ],
			"color" : [ 140, 140, 140 ],
			"pointLight" : true
		}
	}
}
